Subject: [PATCH] feat(overtime): harden immediate supervisor cancel

PATCH /v1/overtime/immediate-supervisor/:overtime_application_id/cancel
body { immediateSupervisorEmployeeId, remarks }
- allowed at any status (also after manager and accomplishment approval)
- 404 not found, 403 not the OT's immediate supervisor, 409 already cancelled
- records cancelled_by / cancelled_at / cancel_remarks (new nullable columns)
- unit tests

